<header><p class="enc-kicker">Work / monument · song</p><h1 class="enc-title">La Marseillaise</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">25 April <a href="/years/1792">1792</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/18th-century">18th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The monarchies of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/europe">Europe</a> feared that the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/french-revolution">French Revolution</a> would spread, and in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/war-of-the-first-coalition">War of the First Coalition</a> they tried to stop it. The Kingdom of the French declared war on <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austria">Austria</a>, the French army fared badly at first, and Coalition armies invaded <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/france">France</a>.</p></div>
